<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:41:12 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>只有 12% 的家族企业到了第三代仍留在家族中。高盛董事长表示乐观是原因</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/family-business-generational-wealth-goldman-sachs-chairman-optimism-advice/</link><description>弗朗索瓦-泽维尔·德马尔曼 (François-Xavier de Mallmann) 负责管理高盛与全球许多最大的家族控制企业的关系。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fx-3.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/family-business-generational-wealth-goldman-sachs-chairman-optimism-advice/</guid></item><item><title>SAP首席量子官：人工智能即将使智能商品化。更好的决策将是下一个竞争优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/sap-chief-quantum-officer-ai-better-decisions/</link><description>从我的角度来看，我在企业量子工作中反复看到同样的初始瓶颈。它很少访问处理器。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Carsten-Polenz.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/sap-chief-quantum-officer-ai-better-decisions/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌 DeepMind 正面临身份危机</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/googles-deepmind-is-having-an-identity-crisis/</link><description>Hassabis 已将日常控制权让给 DeepMind 首席技术官 Koray Kavukcuoglu。事情是这样的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/GettyImages-2261852690-e1776250944805.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:13:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/googles-deepmind-is-having-an-identity-crisis/</guid></item><item><title>近十几家公司已经每月支付高达 10 万美元的费用，以便提前访问特朗普的“真相社交”帖子</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/trump-media-truth-api-insider-trading/</link><description>Truth API 的发布引起了经济学家和法律专家对内幕交易的担忧。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287641110-e1786557827798.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:26:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/trump-media-truth-api-insider-trading/</guid></item><item><title>英伟达希望你的养老基金参与人工智能行业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/nvidia-wants-your-pension-fund-in-the-ai-trade/</link><description>今天的版本：Nvidia 的创意资本；苹果的政治战略、谷歌 DeepMind 戏剧、vibecoding、Uber、Sam Altman 和可穿戴设备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2224782286_94939e-e1786551258824.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:42:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/nvidia-wants-your-pension-fund-in-the-ai-trade/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 13 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-13-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-13.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:15:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-13-2026/</guid></item><item><title>据报道，Anthropic 计划在 10 月份进行 2 万亿美元的 IPO，这是有史以来规模最大的 IPO，这将使 SpaceX 黯然失色</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/anthropic-ipo-2-trillion-october-largest-ever-spacex/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2280291380-e1786612080880.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 09:12:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/anthropic-ipo-2-trillion-october-largest-ever-spacex/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌 DeepMind 首席人工智能执行官 14 岁时开始在印第安纳州以每小时 1 美元左右的价格给玉米去雄：“我的出身非常卑微”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/google-deepmind-lila-ibrahim-corn-detasseling-first-chief-ai-officer-career-advice-humble-beginnings/</link><description>谷歌 DeepMind 的莉拉·易卜拉欣 (Lila Ibrahim) 并没有人工智能出身——她一开始只是在玉米田里做一份 1 美元的工作，父母是移民，而且习惯于承担其他人错过的风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2246843679-e1786533184506.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 13:35:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/google-deepmind-lila-ibrahim-corn-detasseling-first-chief-ai-officer-career-advice-humble-beginnings/</guid></item><item><title>科技公司首席执行官正在撰写 6,500 字的宣言。到底谁在读书？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/tech-ceos-ai-manifesto-zuckerberg-amodei-readership/</link><description>另外：《财富》杂志的所有新闻和闲聊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2235448228-e1786609609208.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 08:31:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/tech-ceos-ai-manifesto-zuckerberg-amodei-readership/</guid></item><item><title>Prime Infra 首席执行官纪尧姆·卢奇 (Guillaume Lucci) 表示，在全国性危机之后，菲律宾需要“各种力量”来建立能源安全</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/prime-infra-guillaume-lucci-philippines-energy-crisis/</link><description>“我们需要的是更多各种能源，而不仅仅是更多的可再生能源，”卢奇在马尼拉帕赛市的公司总部告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Asia-CEO-Interviews-GL.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/prime-infra-guillaume-lucci-philippines-energy-crisis/</guid></item></channel></rss>